        "TileImage": "$($repository 1e142575-830c-4e58-8bdb-8d39b613e406).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Marrakech, where the sands of time meet the rhythm of destiny. Your mission, should you choose to accept it, involves dispatching three high-profile targets who have long galloped beyond the reach of justice. They now reside in this vibrant city, and it’s time to rein in their reign of corruption.\r\rRemember, every gallop, every hoofbeat counts. Good luck, and may your path be as clear as a desert sunrise.",
